#: ../faq/index.rst:5 7622756bacce4e69a1155780779897ec
msgid "Frequently Asked Question (FAQ)"
msgstr "Pogosto zastavljena vprašanja (FAQ)"

#: ../faq/index.rst:9 62852e7cfe7a486796b1ec3d8d784c31
msgid "What if Galette does not work?"
msgstr "Kaj pa, če Galette ne deluje?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:11 389584e839e44d4caed2a7cefeab9ffb
msgid ""
"Sometimes, after an update, a change on hosting, or a simple bug - even "
"minor ones - may cause a fail in Galette. You may observe:"
msgstr ""
"Včasih lahko po posodobitvi sprememba gostovanja ali preprosta napaka – tudi "
"manjša – povzroči napako v Galette. Opazili boste lahko:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:13 ef0fe3d63738417e853caf8b68166892
msgid "an error message is displayed,"
msgstr "prikaže se sporočilo o napaki,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:14 186fcf6b28644306b13eb599fabec38e
msgid "a blank page,"
msgstr "prazna stran,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:15 ../faq/index.rst:75 bd613a239dab4b458f86d36d20e38e49
#: ede10a78499445d88d8a16a524fab9c4
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#: ../faq/index.rst:17 2bed4f88afc24a7bb434d1e6c409d4c9
msgid ""
"In all cases, you **must check the logs**. Most of errors are stored in "
"those files, it is a very good start point to understand the problem and "
"potentially solve it."
msgstr ""
"V vseh primerih morate **preveriti dnevnike**. Večina napak je shranjenih v "
"teh datotekah, kar je zelo dobro izhodišče za razumevanje težave in njeno "
"morebitno rešitev."

#: ../faq/index.rst:19 8e9f26f4c1734b9b8bc40c19a012533b
msgid "Galette logs are stored in the ``galette/data/log`` per default."
msgstr "Dnevniki Galette so privzeto shranjeni v mapi ``galette/data/log``."

#: ../faq/index.rst:21 01b591c8b1b341fea8f32b151d0fe76d
msgid ""
":ref:`Enabling development mode <galettemodes>` will give you more "
"information, and deactivate cache, that may help resolving your issue."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Omogočanje razvojnega načina <galettemodes>` vam bo dalo več "
"informacij in deaktiviralo predpomnilnik, kar vam lahko pomaga rešiti težavo."

#: ../faq/index.rst:25 8a0e1494f37944489eda2a99e248301d
msgid "How to report a bug or ask for a feature?"
msgstr "Kako prijaviti napako ali zahtevati funkcijo?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:27 a540be247006438db955e67d4486cd80
msgid ""
"Bugs reports as well as RFE (Request For Enhancement) must be done on the "
"`Galette tracker <https://bugs.galette.eu/projects/galette>`_, for Galette "
"itself, all official plugins and also documentation."
msgstr ""
"Poročila o hroščih in zahteve za izboljšave (RFE) je treba oddati na "
"sledilniku Galette <https://bugs.galette.eu/projects/galette>`_, in sicer za "
"samo Galette, vse uradne vtičnike in tudi dokumentacijo."

#: ../faq/index.rst:31 571271a7287643f5acfebe0ec4486583
msgid ""
"Unless you are sure you know, please do not attribute the ticket and do not "
"set target version. It will be done when it is taken into account."
msgstr ""
"Če niste prepričani, da veste, prosimo, da ne navajate avtorja zahteve in ne "
"nastavljate ciljne različice. To bo storjeno, ko bo upoštevana."

#: ../faq/index.rst:33 2177e9eb51d04862bfc5c02450a8194d
msgid "If you have doubts, feel free to ask your questions on mailing lists ;)"
msgstr "Če imate dvome, jih lahko postavite na poštnih seznamih ;)"

#: ../faq/index.rst:36 68ea0f1c93c04593b6352c7be06d6acc
msgid "Report a bug"
msgstr "Prijavi hrošča"

#: ../faq/index.rst:38 cbbbef530ef84fd380355394ef51e774
msgid "Please, do not forget to:"
msgstr "Prosim, ne pozabite:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:40 4021f2627c15494692da89c9fcacb03c
msgid "tell us the Galette version you are using,"
msgstr "povejte nam, katero različico Galette uporabljate,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:41 7cb55ad0531d4771a9d34646c79c4294
msgid "be clear and concise,"
msgstr "bodi jasen in jedrnat,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:42 810b4a7a18934519aeb2fc103aae8c40
msgid "to provide all required information in order to reproduce the issue"
msgstr "zagotoviti vse potrebne informacije za reprodukcijo težave"

#: ../faq/index.rst:43 2deaff6bd9584af2b35f4b531aafef8e
msgid "to provide related logs entries."
msgstr "zagotoviti vse potrebne informacije za težave pri reprodukciji."

#: ../faq/index.rst:46 6689f7d8317c4498b8fc2a20ed5850b7
msgid "Request For Enhancement"
msgstr "Zahteva za izboljšavo"

#: ../faq/index.rst:48 4889da6e88874c69a9a5e18da3f39f78
msgid ""
"Make sure to be precise as well on RFEs. Developers may not guess what you "
"have in mind, you have to explain them, event if this seems obvious to "
"you ;) Requested enhancements are tagged as \"Souhaits\" (wishes, in "
"french), and moved by developers when work begins most of the time."
msgstr ""
"Pri zahtevanih izboljšavah bodite natančni. Razvijalci morda ne bodo "
"uganili, kaj imate v mislih, zato jim morate razložiti, tudi če se vam to "
"zdi očitno ;) Zahtevane izboljšave so označene kot \"Souhaits\" (želje, v "
"francoščini) in jih razvijalci večinoma premaknejo, ko se delo začne."

#: ../faq/index.rst:51 643105ba95114119bbdbd74c63bf111a
msgid ""
"Once you made your wishes, you can `submit it to a vote <https://"
"vote.galette.eu/>`_, most wanted features may catch devs attention."
msgstr ""
"Ko enkrat izraziš svoje želje, jih lahko `oddaš na glasovanje <https://"
"vote.galette.eu/>`_, najbolj zaželene funkcije lahko pritegnejo pozornost "
"razvijalcev."

#: ../faq/index.rst:55 dcc3f48422a84cacbcaa274c1994d3ce
msgid "How to search in lists archives?"
msgstr "Kako iskati po arhivih seznamov?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:57 b297bb1184324f0a90a97a82220f4c05
msgid ""
"Mailing lists are the main communication channel for Galette, from its "
"beginnings."
msgstr ""
"Poštni seznami so glavni komunikacijski kanal za Galette, že od samega "
"začetka."

#: ../faq/index.rst:59 4fc06755673b4fdbac88c7f03db8520f
msgid ""
"See `contact page <https://galette.eu/site/contact#mailing-lists>`_ for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Za več informacij glejte stran s kontaktnimi podatki <https://galette.eu/"
"site/contact#mailing-lists>."

#: ../faq/index.rst:61 e4ff92f593a744a28bb22c90b2edebbc
msgid ""
"The most simple and reliable way to `search on past Galette related "
"discussion <https://www.mail-archive.com/search?l=all&q=galette&a=1>`_ is to "
"make a query on mail archive services."
msgstr ""
"Najpreprostejši in najzanesljivejši način za `iskanje preteklih razprav, "
"povezanih z Galette <https://www.mail-archive.com/search?"
"l=all&q=galette&a=1>`_ je poizvedba v storitvah arhiviranja pošte."

#: ../faq/index.rst:65 099c78f8d85742118ef041969a5cfbe7
msgid "How to use same email address for several members?"
msgstr "Kako uporabiti isti e-poštni naslov za več članov?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:67 c05cac0e83fb4b919bad8e0c651c9708
msgid "This is a very frequent question; many would love to do that..."
msgstr "To je zelo pogosto vprašanje; mnogi bi to radi storili ..."

#: ../faq/index.rst:69 2d254ca807f544d19050bc49cd47aaac
msgid "**This is not possible.**"
msgstr "**To ni mogoče.**"

#: ../faq/index.rst:71 10daaaae93df407588da59d247ac2330
msgid ""
"Indeed, mail addresses must be unique in the database. It is a choice for "
"the project on which several features are built:"
msgstr ""
"Dejansko morajo biti poštni naslovi v bazi podatkov edinstveni. To je izbira "
"za projekt, na katerem je zgrajenih več funkcij:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:73 be57d714893c4fd18c1d38da14c11be0
msgid "lost password (since... always or almost),"
msgstr "izgubljeno geslo (od ... vedno ali skoraj),"

#: ../faq/index.rst:74 01ea943b68024864b98239625bfc2dd3
msgid "login (since Galette 0.9),"
msgstr "prijava (od Galette 0.9),"

#: ../faq/index.rst:77 97fec6dc70f54d0b828c9a302f7303f4
msgid ""
"Making them non unique is not a solution we want to rely on. This would be "
"complicated, and should be source of many bugs."
msgstr ""
"To, da jih naredimo ne-edinstvene, ni rešitev, na katero se želimo zanašati. "
"To bi bilo zapleteno in bi moralo biti vir številnih hroščev."

#: ../faq/index.rst:79 92d11e3cbaf547aca7e04b59de82fff3
msgid ""
"However, it is possible in Galette to :ref:`link several members "
"<linkmembers>`. That way, some information such as email and postal "
"addresses will be retrieved from the parent member if missing."
msgstr ""
"Vendar pa je v Galette mogoče :ref:`povezati več članov <linkmembers>`. Na "
"ta način bodo nekatere informacije, kot so e-poštni in poštni naslovi, "
"pridobljene od nadrejenega člana, če manjkajo."

#: ../faq/index.rst:81 f099067e9d674e9faa4a69ab94a8593a
msgid ""
"This allows finally to use a unique email address for several members in "
"database; but they are not duplicates in database."
msgstr ""
"To končno omogoča uporabo edinstvenega e-poštnega naslova za več članov v "
"bazi podatkov; vendar ti niso podvojeni v bazi podatkov."
